Payday for the state; still, AI cos. need incentive.

@randomrecruiter Perhaps the tech industry is a bit different here.

The culture in tech is that if you are a decent engineer, you will have multiple offers and the engineers will juggle the offers to maximize the package for himself.

This approach is normalized.

